      heading: "Context & operational bottleneck",
      paragraphs: [
        "When critical operational rules are buried behind hidden tabs, everyday document requests take more effort than they should. Docket is a B2B SaaS platform that automates the issuance and delivery of complex legal and registry documents across Brazil. Atlas is the company's core operational knowledge base: a CRUD (Create, Read, Update, Delete) system used to look up issuance rules, required fields, jurisdiction types, and delivery methods for thousands of document types.",
