      ],
    },
    {
      heading: "Architectural & UI solution",
      paragraphs: [
        "Using the card-sorting consensus, I replaced the deeply nested tab structure with a scannable dashboard. The redesign surfaces high-priority information together and supports editing individual sections instead of requiring a global edit of the entire record.",
